cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >
  If you use this code or dataset in your research, please cite the associated
  paper using the metadata below.
title: >
  md-emg: Reproducible ML Pipeline for Multimodal English Mispronunciation
  Detection (Acoustic + Surface EMG)
abstract: >
  Companion code and derived tabular dataset for the paper "A Multimodal
  Machine Learning Approach to English Mispronunciation Detection Using Acoustic
  and Surface Electromyographic Signals". Provides a leakage-safe nested
  cross-validation pipeline (5×3×10, StratifiedGroupKFold, 7 classifiers),
  participant-cluster bootstrap confidence intervals, paired permutation tests,
  and Benjamini-Hochberg FDR correction across 20 experimental scenarios.
version: 0.3.5.1
date-released: "2026-11-08"
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/lasaid-udg/multimodal-mispronunciation-detection
keywords:
  - mispronunciation detection
  - surface electromyography
  - acoustic features
  - machine learning
  - nested cross-validation
  - reproducibility
  - pronunciation
  - multimodal
